@CrmTicketing.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5280

### Liveness probe
GET {{CrmTicketing.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### Build / environment info
GET {{CrmTicketing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/info
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{CrmTicketing.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
